---
// 课上反复要提的那种警告，做成一个框，不占标题层级。
//
// A warning that belongs beside the argument rather than above it. Section
// headings are the page's outline; a caution is not a section, so it gets a
// box and not an `h2`. `label` is the short thing it is warning about.
//
// 颜色：左边一道 --at-primary 的实线，正文用 --at-text。标签用
// --at-text-secondary。不给背景色——主题的 --at-bg-alt 在深色下和框线打架，
// 而一道竖线在两种配色里都成立。任何地方不用 opacity。
//
// No background fill: one accent rule on the inline-start edge reads the same
// in both colour schemes, where a tinted panel needs a second value and a
// second contrast measurement. Label is `--at-text-secondary`, measured 8.92:1
// on the page background (Chrome, 2026-09-19); body is `--at-text` at 17.88:1.
// No `opacity` anywhere: in this repo it multiplies against tokens that already
// carry alpha and has failed axe.
interface Props {
  /** Short noun phrase for what is being warned about. */
  label: string;
}

const { label } = Astro.props;
---

{/* div 而不是 aside：aside 是 complementary 地标，同一页放三个就是三个重名地标，
    axe 的 landmark-unique 会红。这个框是页内旁注，不是页面结构的一部分，
    可见的 label 本身就是读屏器读到的第一行。
    Not an `aside`: that is a complementary landmark, and three of them on one
    page fail axe's landmark-unique. This is an inline note, not page structure. */}
<div class="caution">
  <p class="caution__label">{label}</p>
  <div class="caution__body">
    <slot />
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .caution {
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
    padding: 0.85rem 0 0.85rem 1rem;
    border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--at-primary);
  }

  .caution__label {
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--at-text-secondary);
  }

  .caution__body {
    color: var(--at-text);
  }

  /* slot 里是 markdown 段落，收掉首尾的外边距，框才收得住。 */
  .caution__body :global(> :first-child) {
    margin-block-start: 0;
  }

  .caution__body :global(> :last-child) {
    margin-block-end: 0;
  }

  .caution__body :global(p) {
    max-width: 58ch;
  }
</style>
